---
import { BOOKING, CONTACT, GHL } from "~/consts";
---
<section class="wrap" style="padding-block:56px 88px">
  <div style="background:#14142B;color:#fff;border-radius:36px;padding:clamp(32px,5vw,56px)" class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center">
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-4">
      <span class="sticker" style="background:#D4FF4F;color:#14142B;align-self:flex-start">Pronto?</span>
      <h2 style="color:#fff">Prenota in 30 secondi. <span style="color:#D4FF4F">Al resto pensiamo noi.</span></h2>
      <p style="color:#D7D7E6;font-size:18px;max-width:620px">
        Scegli giorno e ora dal calendario: in ufficio a Vigne Nuove o in videochiamata. Ti diciamo noi quali documenti servono.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-3">
      <a class="btn btn-lime btn-lg" href={BOOKING.arcanisGroup} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Prenota in ufficio</a>
      <a class="btn btn-lg" style="background:#fff;color:#14142B" href={BOOKING.arcanisRemote} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Videochiamata? Scrivici su WhatsApp</a>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mt-1">
        <a class="btn btn-sm" style="border-color:#33334D;color:#fff" href={`tel:${CONTACT.phone.landlineRaw}`}>Chiama</a>
        <a class="btn btn-sm" style="background:#25D366;color:#14142B" href={CONTACT.whatsapp.link} target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
      <a href={GHL.richiesta} style="color:#D4FF4F;font-weight:700;text-align:center" class="mt-1">Oppure manda una richiesta online →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
